[quote]
[h2]3.12：统一框架重构与空间分类[/h2]

本次对 Mobile Living 进行了一次框架重构。安装、供电和供水改用公共入口，整理分散的重复判断；按空间分类物品安装，安装方式改为依据原版家具的可移动性、尺寸及摆放属性安装到合理的空间。

[b]生活空间可安装[/b]
[list]
[*]床垫、行军床和支持的睡袋。
[*]普通冰箱、冰柜、可移动单格炉灶和烤箱。
[*]洗衣机、烘干机和洗烘一体机。
[*]地柜、储物柜、置物架、木箱/金属箱，以及受支持的桌子和柜台。制作能力取决于该家具是否具有原版制作台面属性。
[*]老式电视、瓶装水饮水设备；洗碗机仅提供已接入的原版储物/台面能力。
[/list]

[b]车内顶部空间可安装[/b]
[list]
[*]微波炉、迷你冰箱和拖车冰箱。
[*]咖啡机、烤面包机、黑色电视和宽屏电视。
[*]吊柜、壁挂架、医药柜，以及符合尺寸规则的小型抽屉柜、箱子、桌子和柜台。
[/list]

[b]安装限制与旧档[/b]

不可移动设施和跨多格大型家具不开放安装，例如熔炉、铁砧及固定式工作台。

旧档中已经装在生活空间的微波炉等小型设备保留原位并可继续使用；拆下后重新安装时遵循新的顶部空间规则。

如果发现有不兼容旧档的情况，欢迎反馈。
[/quote]

[h1]房车生活 / Mobile Living[/h1]
将受支持的车辆改装成带床铺、储物、家电和车顶装备的移动生活空间。支持 B42.20 单人、多人和专用服务器。

[h2]功能特色[/h2]
[list]
[*]车内休息、收纳和使用设备；咖啡机、烤面包机使用副电瓶，耗电可配置。
[*]配备水箱的车型支持储水、净化及液体转移，车旁可直接使用水箱和行李架上的瓦斯罐。
[*]行李架按车型支持发电机、储物箱、帐篷、油罐、瓦斯罐和备胎。
[*]射灯独立安装，使用主电瓶，随原车大灯开关。
[*]焊接安装车窗护甲和前后防撞杠，具有独立耐久和破损外观；拆毁回收部分材料。底盘改良可大幅提升负重。
[*]车旁快捷操作行李架上的发电机、汽油罐、瓦斯罐和自带水箱；可在沙盒选项关闭快捷菜单。
[*]使用材料安装太阳能板，停车展开为副电瓶充电，移动车辆自动收回；沙盒可关闭此功能。
[/list]

[h2]支持范围[/h2]
[list]
[*]原版 StepVan、Van、SUV、PickUpVan 及指定变种（含邮政版）。客运 Van 仅增加车顶装备，不增加生活空间。
[*]不支持 PickUpTruck、指定警用/救护/广播车型、损毁及烧毁车辆。
[*]可选 KI5 Campers! 适配：六款房车的生活设备位和净水箱，保留原座位、床位与储物。新增车顶改装及护甲仅限受支持的原版车型。
[*]可选 F700 适配：运钞车、SWAT 厢式车及校车/囚车/军用巴士的生活设备位和水箱，保留原储物；SWAT 和巴士可转换原后排座位。
[/list]

[h2]启用方式[/h2]
[list]
[*]原版车辆：VehicleLivingSlots，无需其他 Mod。
[*]KI5 房车：另启用 VehicleLivingSlotsKI5Campers，安装 [url=https://steamcommunity.com/workshop/filedetails/?id=3670064951]KI5 Campers![/url] 和 [url=https://steamcommunity.com/workshop/filedetails/?id=3171167894]damnlib[/url]。
[*]F700：另启用 VehicleLivingSlotsKI5F700，安装 [url=https://steamcommunity.com/workshop/filedetails/?id=3110911330]'87 Ford B700/F700 Trucks[/url] 和 damnlib。
[*]在车辆维修界面安装，材料、工具和技能以菜单为准；固定设施需拆毁移除。多人客户端与服务器须同版本。
[/list][hr][quote]
[h2]3.12: Framework Refactor and Space Categories[/h2]

Mobile Living has undergone a framework refactor. Installation, power and water now use shared entry points, consolidating repeated checks. Items are assigned to suitable installation spaces according to the movability, size and placement properties of their vanilla furniture.

[b]Installable in living spaces[/b]
[list]
[*]Mattresses, camp beds and supported sleeping bags.
[*]Standard refrigerators, freezers, and movable single-tile stoves and ovens.
[*]Washing machines, dryers and washer-dryer combinations.
[*]Base cabinets, storage cabinets, shelves, wooden/metal crates, and supported tables and counters. Crafting support depends on whether the furniture has the vanilla crafting-surface property.
[*]Antique televisions and bottled-water dispensers. Dishwashers provide only the vanilla storage/countertop capabilities that have been integrated.
[/list]

[b]Installable in overhead interior spaces[/b]
[list]
[*]Microwaves, mini fridges and trailer fridges.
[*]Coffee makers, toasters, black televisions and widescreen televisions.
[*]Wall cabinets, wall shelves, medicine cabinets, and small drawer units, crates, tables and counters that meet the size rules.
[/list]

[b]Installation restrictions and existing saves[/b]

Immovable facilities and large furniture spanning multiple tiles cannot be installed, including furnaces, anvils and fixed workbenches.

Small appliances such as microwaves already installed in living spaces in existing saves remain in place and usable. Once removed, they must follow the new overhead-space rules when reinstalled.

If you encounter any compatibility issues with existing saves, please report them.
[/quote]

[h1]English[/h1]
Turn supported vehicles into mobile living spaces with beds, storage, appliances and roof equipment. Supports B42.20 single-player, multiplayer and dedicated servers.

[h2]Features[/h2]
[list]
[*]Rest, store items and use appliances inside. Coffee makers and toasters use the auxiliary battery; power consumption is configurable.
[*]Vehicles with tanks support water storage, purification and transfers. Use vehicle tanks and rack-mounted propane tanks while standing nearby.
[*]Supported roof racks accept generators, storage boxes, tents, fuel cans, propane tanks and spare tyres.
[*]Individually installed spotlights use the main battery and follow the original headlights.
[*]Weld on window armor and front/rear bumper guards with separate durability and damage visuals; destructive removal recovers some materials. Chassis upgrades greatly increase carrying capacity.
[*]Operate rack-mounted generators, petrol cans, propane tanks and built-in water tanks from nearby quick menus; these menus can be disabled in Sandbox Options.
[*]Install solar panels from materials. Deploy while parked to charge the auxiliary battery; movement retracts them. The feature has a sandbox switch.
[/list]

[h2]Supported vehicles[/h2]
[list]
[*]Vanilla StepVan, Van, SUV, PickUpVan and selected variants, including postal vans. Passenger Vans gain roof equipment only, without extra living space.
[*]PickUpTrucks, specified police/ambulance/broadcast variants, wrecks and burnt vehicles are excluded.
[*]Optional KI5 Campers! adds living slots and clean-water tanks to six campers, retaining their seats, beds and storage. Added roof upgrades and armor are limited to supported vanilla vehicles.
[*]Optional F700 adds living slots and tanks to the bank truck, SWAT van, and School/Prison/Military Buses, retaining storage. SWAT and Bus rear seats can be converted.
[/list]

[h2]Setup[/h2]
[list]
[*]Vanilla vehicles: VehicleLivingSlots; no other Mod required.
[*]KI5 campers: also enable VehicleLivingSlotsKI5Campers; install KI5 Campers! and damnlib (links above).
[*]F700: also enable VehicleLivingSlotsKI5F700; install '87 Ford B700/F700 Trucks and damnlib (links above).
[*]Install through vehicle mechanics; see the menu for materials, tools and skills. Fixed fittings require destructive removal. Multiplayer clients and servers must match versions.
[/list]
